        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Every employee is expected to maintain and uphold the integrity of the Department. In satisfying this requirement, it shall be the duty of every employee to report promptly and accurately violations of law that affect the administration of the Department or the laws of the Commonwealth to his/her agency/department head or designee. To the fullest extent possible, any such reports will be treated confidentially.",
